# Every Horde flight path in Kalimdor, from the two capitals out to the level 60 zones, roughly in
# the order of the zones' levels. Polestar knows which flight paths a character has, so each step a
# character already has is passed over: the tour always picks up at the first flight path still
# missing.
#
# The flight points and their flight masters come from Polestar's reference data. Mount Hyjal's two
# are WoW Forever's own: Polestar's data has them since 0.4.0, and they still name their flight
# master (npc). No `next`: an import string may only lead on to a guide the player already imported,
# so each tour ends on its own and its last step points to the other continent's.

guide flight-path-collector/horde-kalimdor
title Flight Paths: Kalimdor (Horde)
faction Horde
category Exploration
folder Flight paths
levels 1-60
zone map 1414
keywords flight path, flight paths, flight point, flight points, flight master, wind rider, FP, taxi, Mount Hyjal
why Every flight path you learn is a walk you never make again, and the tour skips the ones you already have.
version 2

step Orgrimmar
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip The Horde capital, in the north of Durotar.
  getfp "Orgrimmar"

step Crossroads
  zone The Barrens
  tip The Horde town in the middle of the Barrens (levels 10-25), west of Durotar across the river.
  getfp "Crossroads"

step Ratchet
  zone The Barrens
  tip The goblin port on the Barrens' east coast. Its flight master flies both factions, and the boat to Booty Bay leaves from its dock.
  getfp "Ratchet"

step Camp Taurajo
  zone The Barrens
  tip The tauren camp in the south of the Barrens.
  getfp "Camp Taurajo"

step Thunder Bluff
  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip The tauren capital on the mesas of northern Mulgore. The lifts at the foot of the bluff take you up.
  getfp "Thunder Bluff"

step Sun Rock Retreat
  zone Stonetalon Mountains
  tip The Horde town in the middle of the Stonetalon Mountains (levels 15-27).
  getfp "Sun Rock Retreat"

step Zoram'gar Outpost
  zone Ashenvale
  tip The Horde camp on the coast of western Ashenvale (levels 18-30).
  getfp "Zoram'gar Outpost"

step Splintertree Post
  zone Ashenvale
  tip The Horde post in eastern Ashenvale, north of the Barrens.
  getfp "Splintertree Post"

step Freewind Post
  zone Thousand Needles
  tip The tauren post on the mesas in the middle of Thousand Needles (levels 25-35). The Great Lift in the south of the Barrens takes you down into the canyon.
  getfp "Freewind Post"

step Camp Mojache
  zone Feralas
  tip The tauren camp in eastern Feralas, west of Thousand Needles. Feralas is a level 40-50 zone: below that, keep to the road.
  getfp "Camp Mojache"

step Shadowprey Village
  zone Desolace
  tip The Horde village on the south-west coast of Desolace (levels 30-40), north of Feralas.
  getfp "Shadowprey Village"

step Brackenwall Village
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip The Horde village in the north-west of Dustwallow Marsh (levels 35-45), east of the Barrens.
  getfp "Brackenwall Village"

step Gadgetzan
  zone Tanaris
  tip The goblin town in the north of Tanaris (levels 40-50), south of Thousand Needles past the Shimmering Flats.
  getfp "Gadgetzan"

step Marshal's Refuge
  zone Un'Goro Crater
  tip The explorers' camp at the north end of Un'Goro Crater (levels 48-55), west of Tanaris. Its flight master flies both factions.
  getfp "Marshal's Refuge"

step Cenarion Hold
  zone Silithus
  tip The Cenarion Circle's town in the north of Silithus (levels 55-60).
  getfp "Cenarion Hold"

step Valormok
  zone Azshara
  tip The Horde camp in western Azshara (levels 45-55), east of Ashenvale.
  getfp "Valormok"

step Bloodvenom Post
  zone Felwood
  tip The Horde camp in the middle of Felwood (levels 48-55), north of Ashenvale.
  getfp "Bloodvenom Post"

step Moonglade
  zone Moonglade
  tip The druids' valley north of Felwood, reached through the furbolg tunnels of Timbermaw Hold. The furbolgs attack until your standing with Timbermaw Hold reaches Unfriendly (killing Deadwood furbolgs in Felwood raises it); at level 60 you can run straight through.
  getfp "Moonglade"

step Everlook
  zone Winterspring
  tip The goblin town in Winterspring (levels 55-60). Take the Winterspring exit of the Timbermaw Hold tunnels and follow the road east.
  getfp "Everlook"

step Tainted Foothills
  zone Mount Hyjal
  tip Mount Hyjal is WoW Forever's own zone (levels 54-60), entered from the south of Winterspring through Darkwhisper Gorge. The step ticks itself when Bluebell's flight map opens (with a Polestar older than 0.4, tick it off yourself).
  getfp "Tainted Foothills" npc 260626

step Summit of Eternity
  zone Mount Hyjal
  tip In the north-east of Mount Hyjal. Like the Tainted Foothills, it ticks itself when Fayran Elthas's flight map opens. It is the last Horde flight path in Kalimdor: for the other continent, open Flight Paths: Eastern Kingdoms (Horde).
  getfp "Summit of Eternity" npc 41861
